#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:5 03b529fd6f6e45949f25cc2f9dde0e08
msgid "Tilt Rotor Setup Tips"
msgstr "倾转旋翼安装调试技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:7 a9754cfa9ea041d9b5391a1f8f25ef04
msgid ""
"Once you have the servo function assignment completed, and other "
"parameters discussed in :ref:`guide-tilt-rotor` entered, you can begin to"
" setup the tilt mechanism's travel and range."
msgstr "完成舵机功能分配并输入 :ref:`guide-tilt-rotor` 中讨论的其他参数后，可以开始设置倾转机构的行程和范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:10 717a335e378a4fe6aa83a323aa1d16b1
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner's SETUP (or Initial Setup depending on release "
"version) menu, under Mandatory Hardware/Servo Outputs you will see each "
"outputs assignment, min/max/trim, and reverse. You will be switching back"
" and forth between this tab and the DATA (previously Flight Data) tab "
"several times."
msgstr ""
"在Mission "
"Planner的SETUP（或初始设置，具体取决于发布版本）菜单中，在必要硬件/舵机输出下，您将看到每个输出的分配、最小/最大/配平值和反向设置。您将在此选项卡和DATA（之前称为飞行数据）选项卡之间来回切换多次。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:12 26f7d9aaf3e94938a32c42d61be98fc5
msgid ""
"Misalignment as the motors transition to/from forward flight can have a "
"big impact on smoothness or even airworthiness. It is worthwhile to the "
"get them synchronized and aligned as precisely as possible."
msgstr "电机在过渡到/从前飞时的不对齐对平稳性甚至适航性有很大影响。值得尽可能精确地使它们同步和对齐。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:15 91b3d9405dbd498e8857e02e4b62442f
msgid "Mechanical Setup"
msgstr "机械安装"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:17 b3891d72ff934d9bb2277613ea2f1232
msgid ""
"Remove props! Power the aircraft to enable servo's to be active (safety "
"switch activation may be required). Do not turn on your transmitter. We "
"want it to remain unarmed but servos active."
msgstr "取下螺旋桨！给飞机通电以使舵机处于活动状态（可能需要激活安全开关）。不要打开遥控器。我们希望飞机保持未解锁状态但舵机处于活动状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:18 0a3d870700ca446787302aec8f002d86
msgid ""
"If vectored assist in fixed wing flight is going to be used "
"(:ref:`Q_TILT_FIX_ANGLE<Q_TILT_FIX_ANGLE>` is non zero), be sure to set "
"the parameter as it will affect the nominal forward thrust position of "
"the motor during setup. The same is true for vectored yaw, be sure to set"
" the :ref:`Q_TILT_YAW_ANGLE<Q_TILT_YAW_ANGLE>` before proceeding."
msgstr ""
"如果将在固定翼飞行中使用矢量辅助（:ref:`Q_TILT_FIX_ANGLE<Q_TILT_FIX_ANGLE>` "
"非零），请确保在设置时设置该参数，因为它会影响安装过程中电机的标称前飞推力位置。矢量偏航同理，在继续之前确保设置 "
":ref:`Q_TILT_YAW_ANGLE<Q_TILT_YAW_ANGLE>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:19 f3c270f1a1a54495a391c3575812a4c8
msgid ""
"Attach the tilt servo's output arm to the servo, or attach the servo to "
"the tilt mechanism if direct mount style, such that it will produce equal"
" travel from horizontal to vertical position. This is done while the "
"servo is at mid-range (1500us). You can set the assigned tilt servos' "
"output min/max both to equal 1500 in Mission Planner,so they will be "
"driven to that value only in any mode, for now."
msgstr ""
"将倾转舵机的输出臂连接到舵机，或将舵机连接到倾转机构（如果是直接安装式），使其从水平到垂直位置产生相等的行程。这在舵机处于中间位置（1500us）时完成。您可以在Mission"
" Planner中将分配的倾转舵机的输出最小/最大均设置为1500，这样在任何模式下它们都只会驱动到该值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:20 ba004b9f0de1424080577b194c61ce30
msgid ""
"Attach and adjust the linkage (if not direct mount style) such that the "
"line from pivot point to ball link on the pivot arm and the output arm "
"are at the same angle. Set the servo min/max to 1300/1700, respectively."
msgstr "连接并调整连杆（如果不是直接安装式），使从枢轴点到枢轴臂球形连接和输出臂处于相同角度。将舵机最小/最大分别设置为1300/1700。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:21 9201458ec41a4b33b4205ff0d6a632c8
msgid ""
"Go to the ``DATA`` menu, use the ``Actions`` tab to use the ``SetMode`` "
"button, and select MANUAL mode, if not already there. It will ask if you "
"really want to do this since it's unarmed. Click yes. Check that the "
"motors moved to forward flight position (more or less since range is very"
" restricted now to prevent overrunning), then change mode to QSTABILIZE "
"and check for movement toward vertical. Go back to Mission Planner "
"``SETUP``/Mandatory Hardware/Servo Output and reverse tilt servos as "
"required to get proper direction."
msgstr ""
"进入 ``DATA`` 菜单，使用 ``Actions`` 选项卡上的 ``SetMode`` "
"按钮，选择MANUAL模式（如果尚未在此模式）。系统会询问您是否真的要这样做，因为飞机未解锁。点击是。检查电机是否移动到前飞位置（由于范围现在非常有限以防止过度运行，大致位置即可），然后切换到QSTABILIZE模式并检查是否向垂直方向移动。返回Mission"
" Planner的 ``SETUP``/必要硬件/舵机输出，根据需要反转倾转舵机以获得正确方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:22 cced94a71fdb4933876b12198c08f6ea
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now we will adjust travel. It's an iterative process, changing the value "
"in MANUAL mode for one endpoint (min or max, depending on servo "
"direction), then changing to QSTABLIZE and adjusting the other endpoint. "
"The Servo Output screen is a \"live screen\". When you change it, its "
"value is instantly reflected in servo output. You will want to be sure "
"that the MANUAL mode position places both motors against the stops (if "
"used), in full forward flight position with just a little bit of torque. "
"Too much torque and the servo will overheat. Too little, and you get a "
"loose position which can bounce a bit in the air. You want both motors "
"EXACTLY aligned with props back on, a difference in fixed wing mode will "
"result in roll force. Enough misalignment and you won't be able to stop "
"the roll with full aileron!"
msgstr "现在我们将调整行程。这是一个迭代过程，在MANUAL模式下更改一个端点（最小或最大，取决于舵机方向）的值，然后切换到QSTABLIZE并调整另一个端点。舵机输出屏幕是「实时屏幕」。更改时，其值立即反映在舵机输出中。您需要确保MANUAL模式位置使两个电机紧贴挡块（如果有），处于完全前飞位置并带有一点扭矩。扭矩过大舵机会过热，扭矩过小会导致位置松动，在空中可能会抖动。装上螺旋桨后，需要两个电机完全对齐，在固定翼模式下的任何差异都会产生横滚力。不对齐足够严重时，全副翼也无法阻止横滚！"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:23 7a1c680416d3497f94c86a97e22e693b
msgid ""
"In QSTABILIZE, both motors should be aligned. They can be vertical, but "
"you can set them up such that when the AHRS horizon is level, they are. "
"This results in them pointing a little forward when the airframe is flat "
"(and the horizon will be 2-5 deg negative since you are not in flying "
"attitude)....read https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/quadplane-tips.html "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"在QSTABILIZE模式下，两个电机应对齐。它们可以是垂直的，但您可以设置为当AHRS地平线水平时对齐。这导致当机架平放时它们略微朝前（地平线将为负2-5度，因为您不处于飞行姿态）……更多信息请参阅"
" https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/quadplane-tips.html。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:24 7f4874be638e4c2fa3fcc9e5e73b0ba6
msgid ""
"Finally, be sure that the servos max and min values that you have set, "
"can actually be obtained. For vectored yaw, you can set Q_OPTIONS bit 10 "
"to allow yaw (rudder stick input) on the bench in QSTABILIZE to check "
"ranges. For fixed wing tilt assist, you can set the "
":ref:`Q_TILT_FIX_GAIN<Q_TILT_FIX_GAIN>` temporarily to 1.0 and move the "
"elevator and aileron sticks to the their limits in MANUAL mode to drive "
"the tilts."
msgstr ""
"最后，确保您设置的舵机最大和最小值实际上可以达到。对于矢量偏航，可以在QSTABILIZE模式下将Q_OPTIONS第10位设置为1，以允许在桌面上通过偏航（方向舵摇杆输入）来检查范围。对于固定翼倾斜辅助，可以将"
" :ref:`Q_TILT_FIX_GAIN<Q_TILT_FIX_GAIN>` "
"临时设置为1.0，并在MANUAL模式下将升降舵和副翼摇杆移至极限来驱动倾转机构。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:29 d0210792f39d47eaaa4b36b43a404d59
msgid ""
"(Photo courtesy of `Mark Qvale "
