"<http://www.itsqv.com/QVM/index.php?title=X-UAV_Mini_Talon_VTOL_Project>`__"
" 提供）"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:31 f83c599aee8c4841ae7dd63497b34e8b
msgid "Once setup, double check alignment several times in both modes."
msgstr "安装完成后，在两种模式下多次双重检查对齐情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:33 a744a94eb38b46b8888afd8df3790f55
msgid ""
"You can watch that both move exactly in sync by setting "
":ref:`Q_TILT_RATE_DN<Q_TILT_RATE_DN>` =0  and "
":ref:`Q_TILT_RATE_UP<Q_TILT_RATE_UP>`  =2 (degs/second) temporarily. But "
"you must use FBA/FBWB/ or STABILIZE instead of MANUAL mode for the "
"forward flight mode for this test since MANUAL mode forces the downward "
"rate to be at least 90 degs/sec."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过将 :ref:`Q_TILT_RATE_DN<Q_TILT_RATE_DN>` =0 和 "
":ref:`Q_TILT_RATE_UP<Q_TILT_RATE_UP>` "
"=2（度/秒）临时设置来观察两者是否完全同步移动。但对于此测试，必须使用FBA/FBWB/或STABILIZE而非MANUAL模式作为前飞模式，因为MANUAL模式强制向下速率至少为90度/秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-rotor-tips.rst:35 446d201ea79a49309655517ca6345550
msgid ""
"Finally, go to the ``SETUP``/Optional Hardware/Motors tab and click Motor"
" A,B,and D (for a Tricopter Tilt QuadPlane) in sequence to verify motor "
"direction is correct (without props!)"
msgstr ""
"最后，进入 "
"``SETUP``/可选硬件/电机选项卡，依次点击电机A、B和D（对于三旋翼倾转QuadPlane），验证电机方向是否正确（不带螺旋桨！）"

